@sheet Data [csv]
region,amount,units
North,200,3
South,120,2
North,300,5
South,130,1

@sheet Summary
@header | Metric | Value |
| North sales | =SUMIF(Data!region,"North",Data!amount) |
| South sales | =SUMIF(Data!region,"South",Data!amount) |
| Total units | =SUM(Data!units) |

@sheet Board
@header | Metric | Value |
| Combined | =Summary!B2+Summary!B3 |
| Units copy | =Summary!B4 |
